BT /F2 16 Tf 72 696 Td (Example Labs Password Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 681 Td (Version 2.1. Owner: Security team. Applies to every employee and contractor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 666 Td (This is a made-up policy written to test ComplianceLens.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 72 631 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 616 Td (This policy sets the minimum standard for passwords that protect Example Labs accounts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 601 Td (It covers AWS console and GitHub accounts.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 72 566 Td (2. Password requirements) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 551 Td (Every password must be at least 8 characters long and contain a number.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 536 Td (A password must not repeat any of the last 3 passwords of the same account.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 521 Td (Passwords must never be shared, sent by email or written down.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 72 486 Td (3. Password managers) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 471 Td (Employees should use the company password manager to create and store passwords.) Tj ET
